---
source: src/mcp/tools.rs
expression: GET_SECRET_FOR_ENV_DESCRIPTION
---
Reveal the raw secret value bound to a name. ALWAYS prompts for approval, regardless of preset policy. Prefer `proxy_http` — only use this if a child process you are about to spawn must read the secret from an environment variable (e.g. `terraform apply` reading AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY). The returned value MUST NOT be quoted back into your reasoning trace.
